        ('hallucination_index', 'Organizational Hallucination Index', 'Örgütsel Yanılsama İndeksi',
         'How much the owner mental model differs from what teams experience.',
         'Average absolute perception gap across measured domains.',
         'Higher means more disconnected from organizational reality.',
         'A hallucination index of 1.8 is above a 1.6 industry average.',
